>>
endobj
282 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 638 0 R
/E (The response from Qwen:7B is relatively brief and lacks the comprehensive structure seen in the other two models. Additionally, it contains several flaws, such as missing or incorrect subjects in some sentences, which affect the clarity and readability of the answer.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
283 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 639 0 R
/E (Compared to the other two models, we consider Gemini's responses to be in the middle. In terms of completeness, it is slightly inferior to LLaMA3, and for certain questions, it tends to give ambiguous answers. However, the summaries it provides are still of certain reference value.)
/Pg 29 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
