/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (Purpose Statement: "Sports Vision" currently does not offer an automatic related article recommendation feature, making it difficult for users to conveniently find content that is similar in topic or context when reading specific news or reports. To enhance user experience and improve the efficiency of information exploration, we have developed a related article recommendation system based on semantic analysis. This feature helps users quickly identify reports that are closely related in content and timeliness to the article they are reading.)
/E (Purpose Statement: "Sports Vision" currently does not offer an automatic related article recommendation feature, making it difficult for users to conveniently find content that is similar in topic or context when reading specific news or reports. To enhance user experience and improve the efficiency of information exploration, we have developed a related article recommendation system based on semantic analysis. This feature helps users quickly identify reports that are closely related in content and timeliness to the article they are reading.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [1]
>>
